<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a 13th tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.75 pct vs	6.59 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.66 pct vs	7.50 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 94.65     vs     95.70</p>
<p> Bids		 2.957 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of an 11th tranche of the 10-year BTP on April 15.</p>
</text>
